WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:13.327
Feather flew all over the field.

2
00:00:13.328 --> 00:00:19.858
She dug in the mud.

3
00:00:19.859 --> 00:00:29.951
But there was no sign of the gold whistle.

4
00:00:29.952 --> 00:00:33.811
Feather groaned.

5
00:00:33.812 --> 00:00:37.392
"I don’t know what to do," she thought.

6
00:00:37.393 --> 00:00:40.475
"We need that wishbit!"

7
00:00:40.476 --> 00:00:50.289
Soon the rain stopped, and the sun came out.

8
00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:54.903
Feather kept searching.

9
00:00:54.904 --> 00:01:04.446
Then something in the grass flashed.

10
00:01:04.447 --> 00:01:09.886
"The whistle!" Feather raced over.

11
00:01:09.887 --> 00:01:16.771
Clutching the whistle, Feather flew fast.

12
00:01:16.772 --> 00:01:23.062
The other fairies were waiting for her at Mabel's house.

13
00:01:23.063 --> 00:01:28.308
"Feather!" Sprite cried. "What took you so long?"

14
00:01:28.309 --> 00:01:34.738
Bumble bit his lip. "We were getting really worried."

15
00:01:34.739 --> 00:01:38.152
"I'll explain everything later," Feather said.

16
00:01:38.153 --> 00:01:46.265
"We need to return the wishbit—fast!"

17
00:01:46.266 --> 00:01:49.261
Feather dropped the whistle near the soccer net.

18
00:01:49.262 --> 00:01:56.170
Then the fairies waited in a bush.

19
00:01:56.171 --> 00:02:02.521
A few minutes later, Mabel came outside with a ball.

20
00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:10.407
She kicked it into the net a few times.

21
00:02:10.408 --> 00:02:13.895
"Mabel looks sad," Hob whispered.

22
00:02:13.896 --> 00:02:23.732
"I bet she's thinking about her puppy wish," Bumble said.

23
00:02:23.733 --> 00:02:31.849
"My gold whistle!" Mabel cried suddenly.

24
00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:35.015
"I thought it was lost forever."

25
00:02:35.016 --> 00:02:37.623
She picked it up.

26
00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:39.795
Tweet! Tweet!

27
00:02:39.796 --> 00:02:42.329
Mabel blew into the whistle . . .

28
00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:56.367
And something small and furry ran toward her.

29
00:02:56.368 --> 00:03:02.158
"Aw!" Feather whispered. "A cute little puppy!"

30
00:03:02.159 --> 00:03:05.263
Just then a woman ran toward Mabel.

31
00:03:05.264 --> 00:03:09.361
"Sorry! One of my dog’s puppies ran away!"

32
00:03:09.362 --> 00:03:14.353
Mabel giggled as the dog licked her face.

33
00:03:14.354 --> 00:03:18.034
"Would you like a puppy?" the woman asked.

34
00:03:18.035 --> 00:03:20.865
"We need to find a good home for her."

35
00:03:20.866 --> 00:03:23.611
"Yes!" Mabel cried.

36
00:03:23.612 --> 00:03:30.132
"I wished for a puppy for my birthday."

37
00:03:30.133 --> 00:03:32.862
Feather wiped a tear away.

38
00:03:32.863 --> 00:03:38.278
"That puppy will have such a happy home."

39
00:03:38.279 --> 00:03:42.205
"Speaking of home . . ." Sprite looked at Feather.

40
00:03:42.206 --> 00:03:47.416
"We need to go home so you can get clean."

41
00:03:47.417 --> 00:03:51.969
Feather grinned. "I'm fine.

42
00:03:51.970 --> 00:04:10.505
A little dirt never hurt anyone!"

